# Desire Comfort Design System

Full guide: `.cursor/skills/desirecomfort-design/SKILL.md` and `doc/design system/DESIGN.md`

## Top 5 Rules

1. **No shadows** — flat surfaces only; depth from color contrast and photography
2. **Outlined buttons** — transparent fill, 1px border, 8px radius; no filled CTAs
3. **ModernEra only** — sole typeface; weights 400/500; max 40px display size
4. **Use token vars** — `warm-parchment`, `walnut-shell`, `obsidian`, etc.; no hardcoded hex in JSX
5. **Sharp images** — `rounded-none` on images/cards; 8px radius on buttons/links only

Invoke `/desirecomfort-design` for full design system work or rebrand migration.
